      "title": "Task status and editable fields",
      "classification": "confirmed_project_fact",
      "text": "English test adaptation: Only active tasks enter new planning. Completed and cancelled tasks remain in history and cannot be reactivated. Dispatchers can complete or cancel active tasks, correct damage labels or update validated locations. Crew accounts can complete only server-verified assigned tasks. The backend derives severity, priority and duration from frozen rules. Task changes increment the planning revision and make saved plans stale. Recalculation is explicit and must use one consistent task snapshot.",
